y hand against the numerous draws on the board and to extract value from weaker pairs (like a pair of 9s or 6s) or draws that call, betting is the optimal strategy. Checking is dangerous due to the "wet" board texture. A bet of 200 chips serves to build the pot slightly while denying a free card to the opponent.\n\nAnswer: 200'}
