ontrol the size of the pot, keeping it small while you evaluate the turn card. Since you have Top Pair, you have showdown value, but you do not want to face a large raise that would force you to fold or commit chips with a marginal kicker. Checking also disguises your hand strength and may induce the opponent to bluff on later streets.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
